    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "LeT RIa MaKe\nYOUR ReSERVaTIOn\nTONIGHT\nRIA is Rodeway's very own reservations\nin advance system. One toll-free call\nfrom anywhere in the continental\nUnited States gets you confirmed\nreservations at any Rodeway Inn. That's\nall there is to it\nYou do the Traveling...Leave the REST to us.\nFOR RESERVATIONS NOW,\nCALL TOLL FREE\n(800) 228-2000\nRODEWAY\nINNS\nOF AMERICA\n®",
      "SAN FRANCISCO\nAIRLINE\nTIMETABLE\nFEBRUARY\n1974\nPublished by: Transportation Displays, Inc.",
      "Unlimited\nMileage\nAs Low as\n$29.95\nReturn to\nRenting City\nEnjoy Our 3-Day Weekend\nNATIONAL\nCAR RENTAL\nWe feature GM cars\nIn Seattle Call (206) 433-5500\n6 PM Thurs.\nto 6 PM Mon.\n$21\nPlus 124\na Mile\nTry Our 4-Day Weekend\nNATIONAL\nCAR RENTAL\nWe feature GM cars\nIn Seattle Call (206) 433-5500\nSAN FRANCISCO\nINTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\nPARKING SERVICES\nGARAGE AND\nPARKING LOT 1\nClosest to Terminals: The Garage provides the\nonly indoor parking available at the Airport.\nPARKING LOT 2 \u0026 B\nAdjacent to Garage there is less entry conges-\ntion and lower parking fee - free shuttle to all\nTerminals.\nAIRPORT\nSHUTTLE PARKING\nAvoid heavy traffic - easy entry. Lowest rates\navailable. Free continuous shuttle service from\nyour car to any Terminal. Use \"Airport Shops\"\nturn-off from U.S. 101.\nFROM\nSAN F\nTERMINAL \u0026 PARKING\nMAP\nUNITED\nGARAGE\n\u0026 PARKING\nLOT 1\nUNITED\nSFO HELICOPTER\nPARKING\nLOT 2 \u0026 B\nLOT B\nUPPER ROADWAY (Departures-Tickets)\nLOWER ROADWAY (Arrivals-Baggage)\n* AIRPORT SHUTTLE PARKING STOP\n+ VALET PARKING\nAIRPORT\nSHUTTLE\nPARKING\n- US 101\nTO SAN JOSE +\n- US 101\nTURN OFF\nAIRPORT SHOPS EXIT\n----\nIF YOU WOULD LIKE THIS MONTHLY FLIGHT SCHEDULE MAILED TO YOU, PLEASE FILL OUT THE FORM\nBELOW AND MAIL TO: SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORTS COMMISSION, ATTENTION: PUBLIC\nRELATIONS DEPARTMENT, SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT, SAN FRANCISCO, CA. 94128.\nPLEASE TYPE OR PRINT...\nNAME_\nADDRESS\nCITY\nSTATE\nZIP"
    ],
